# Normalize to LF in the repository. This is not cosmetic: a shell script that
# reaches a Linux container with CRLF endings fails with a confusing
# "bad interpreter: no such file or directory", because the \r becomes part of
# the interpreter path. Contributors on Windows would otherwise break the
# container images just by checking out.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.jar binary
